        <mxCell id="c81" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#FF0000&quot;&gt;* Every browser call goes CloudFront → WAF → API Gateway (JWT authorizer), shown as one lifeline.&lt;br&gt;* Nothing is written to Aurora until you confirm (step 5). Statement PDFs and passwords never leave the browser.&lt;br&gt;* Each reconcile request finishes within ~30 s; the app keeps calling until all new emails are processed.&lt;br&gt;* Optional: Expenses fetches a reference FX rate when a foreign-currency receipt has no PHP amount (not shown).&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="2126" width="1100" height="70" as="geometry" />
